    "description": "This API enables the batch activation of telecom SIM cards, facilitating seamless integration for service providers. It streamlines the process of activating multiple SIMs simultaneously, thus enhancing operational efficiency. Typical consumers of this API include telecom operators and customers managing large volumes of SIM activations. By utilizing this endpoint, businesses can significantly reduce the time and effort associated with individual SIM activations.",
